{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/207340-that-s-not-a-ghost-book-at-home","id":207340,"title":"\"That's not a ghost!\" (Book at home)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-24T11:26:24-07:00","id":207340,"title":"\"That's not a ghost!\" (Book at home)","content":"So a Krewe is investigating a haunting. Turns out it's not a ghost, it's a demon, or a spirit, or some kind of Abyssal manifestation, a Strix, whatever. What kinds of tricks do Sin Eaters have to offer?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T12:02:05-07:00","id":207382,"title":"","content":"Some Storytellers will let you interact with any ephemeral being in Twilight by using 'Reverse Possession'; though I don't think that's strictly RAW. Beyond that, the concept of an anchor still applies pretty broadly to ephemerals; something physical reinforces their idea and allows them to interact with things - so end that condition, end the haunting. Probably. And there's always asking around for help..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Second Chance for<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=709\" data-tempid=\"temp_709_1572548741915_354\" /><br /> A Beautiful Madness</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","name":"Seraph Kitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar425_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T12:22:36-07:00","id":207400,"title":"","content":"I'm of the mind that Reverse Possession lets you deal with things in Twilight by dint of it putting you into Twilight (sort of). The book actually talks about how sometimes Werewolves and Sin-eaters might work together to deal with Spirits that are causing trouble, actually.<br /> <br /> That said, as long as a Sin-eater can interact with something, they can probably kick the crap out of it. Manifestations are some of the most powerful abilities, and even without them, Sin-eaters have one of the widest arrays of template powers. Most Sin-eaters are never unarmed, for instance. (Although admittedly not every Keystone works as an improvised weapon; some of them are just shoes or rags as opposed to brooms or knives or <i>ship anchors</i>.) They also can Bulwark, although that doesn't always do much at lower levels, and only works as much as they've got Health. The <i>Ghostwalker</i> chapter in <i>Mortal Remains</i> really shows off how crazy Sin-eaters can get, though. They might not have the ability to deal with a Strix or Acamoth on it's own terms, but unless it's very high Rank, they can generally do enough outright <i>damage</i> to force it away.<br /> <br /> I guess what I'm saying is &quot;Sin-eaters STRONK&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T16:17:26-07:00","id":207640,"title":"","content":"I've run a number of encounters with Sin-Eaters and other foes. My Krewe has faced down Abyssal Entities, Spirits, even to a limited degree Strix.<br /> <br /> As noted in the other thread, Warding Circle/Warding Household works against threats beyond ghosts. And Reverse Possession allows interaction with creatures in Twilight. The end result is most critters can't dematerialize to hide from Sin-Eaters (though unlike with ghosts it does take some effort to see them) and they can ward.<br /> <br /> However, Sin-Eaters are fairly strong, and most rapidly get a number of powers due to how Keys and Manifestations interact. When not dealing with ghosts a percentage of these become useless; against a non-ghost foe, the Stigmata Key is usually of limited usefulness, for example. Of course there are exceptions (Stigmata Rage, for example) while some keys (like Industrial) are full of uses against non ghosts for nearly any manifestation.<br /> <br /> The Sin-Eaters greatest ability, though, against even alien-minded foes is psychological. They are rare enough few critters know much about them. They don't die, well, not for any length of time. They cannot be possessed, they cannot be knocked unconscious or put under. They shrug off attacks with white smoke. That's before you even get into their Manifestations; Their Scrying abilities are beyond the scope of anything but a Mage, and many are nearly impossible to hurt to begin with (especially under GMC rules). And, of course, their ability to utilize and empower ghosts. The thing with Sin-Eaters is that it is almost always easier to not engage them. Move on. Obviously Abyssal Entities are unlikely to decide that, but many spirits will recognize a superior predator quickly.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-25T00:38:54-07:00","id":207981,"title":"","content":"Depends on whether you are trying to use the current or GMC rules here.<br /> <br /> Pre-GMC, twilight is twilight, post GMC, ephemeral beings in twilight can only attack their own type of being unless they are armed with their target's banes. So a sin-eater looking to branch out from ghost busting would be advised to put points into esoteric armory if they want the option to go into twilight and wail on a spirit or other ephemeral type. <br /> <br /> So in GMC since geists are ghosts plus, reverse possession should only be effective against beings on the same wavelength as ghosts.<br /> <br /> On the bright side, with an essence thief fetter, a sin-eater can chow down on all forms of ephemerals just like he can on ghosts,although ones doctor would probably not recommend the eating of demons, they're likely to disagree with you. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":391,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","user":"StSword","date":". 07-25-2014, 03:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-25T02:20:09-07:00","id":208044,"title":"","content":"I'm suddenly reminded how much I want a Geist update for GMC. They kind of <i>are</i> so powerful that they're damned near impossible to damage with some of their armour and Defense boosting abilities. And that's not even touching on how many of their powers would create Conditions under GMC.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baron Samedi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/207340-that-s-not-a-ghost-book-at-home?p=207640#post207640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They cannot be possessed</div> </div> </div> </div>That's one of those things that makes sense in hindsight, but I never really realized before. I was actually wondering how they'd handle the Strix's possession abilities, but... they're kind of already spoken for. Bit crowded inside of a Sin-eater as it is, and three's a crowd.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T09:20:49-07:00","id":209366,"title":"","content":"I must say that the first thing I thought about was the scene from Paranormal Activity where the medium has ran away from the house, screaming &quot;This is not my area of expertise!&quot; :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T12:59:08-07:00","id":209479,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/207340-that-s-not-a-ghost-book-at-home?p=207981#post207981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Depends on whether you are trying to use the current or GMC rules here.<br /> <br /> Pre-GMC, twilight is twilight, post GMC, ephemeral beings in twilight can only attack their own type of being unless they are armed with their target's banes. So a sin-eater looking to branch out from ghost busting would be advised to put points into esoteric armory if they want the option to go into twilight and wail on a spirit or other ephemeral type.<br /> <br /> So in GMC since geists are ghosts plus, reverse possession should only be effective against beings on the same wavelength as ghosts.<br /> <br /> On the bright side, with an essence thief fetter, a sin-eater can chow down on all forms of ephemerals just like he can on ghosts,although ones doctor would probably not recommend the eating of demons, they're likely to disagree with you. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>It depends. We don't have an &quot;official&quot; GMC conversion yet, it depends on if the GM wants to keep with them being able to interact with Spirits or not. That was part of the original intent of the power.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T13:19:06-07:00","id":209490,"title":"","content":"I've been on the internet too long. I saw the title in my peripheral vision and thought it said &quot;Not All Ghosts&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T13:37:18-07:00","id":209503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/207340-that-s-not-a-ghost-book-at-home?p=207981#post207981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pre-GMC, twilight is twilight, post GMC, ephemeral beings in twilight can only attack their own type of being unless they are armed with their target's banes. So a sin-eater looking to branch out from ghost busting would be advised to put points into esoteric armory if they want the option to go into twilight and wail on a spirit or other ephemeral type.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's more that Spirits can't steal Essence from Ghosts and vice versa.<br /> <br /> If you're able to punch things in Twilight, you should be able to punch anything in Twilight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T22:34:44-07:00","id":210880,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aspel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/207340-that-s-not-a-ghost-book-at-home?p=209503#post209503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it's more that Spirits can't steal Essence from Ghosts and vice versa.<br /> <br /> If you're able to punch things in Twilight, you should be able to punch anything in Twilight.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If one wanted to make no sense whatsoever, sure, we could go with that. But whether an ephemeral of the wrong type can steal another ephemeral's essence is covered solely by whether the would be thief has the essence thief numina, nothing else.<br /> <br /> Also the book specifically says that only things of the same type of ephemera can even touch another ephemeral being, and it specifically says that ephemeral beings can only be attacked by beings of the same ephemeral type unless the other ephemeral is wielding a bane.<br /> <br /> Banes do actual corpus damage, whereas essence stealing is a contested roll of power plus finesse versus power and resistance, that's vastly different from rolling power plus finesse versus defense to do damage. <br /> <br /> If the writers wanted spirits, ghosts, and angels to be able to physically interact while in Twilight I figure they wouldn't have specifically said twice that they can't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":391,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","user":"StSword","date":". 07-28-2014, 01:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}